WEBVTT

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.390
It's here again! It's here again!

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.150
You Too, Let's Go to the National Tournament

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.800
The shop tournament season!

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.430
Another passionate battle between 
the chosen Cardfighters!

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:12.150
The Customary Fall Shop Tournament

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.710
Sunday of next week!

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:19.570
This time for sure... This 
time for sure, I'll...

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.160
Take revenge?

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.350
Get Ninja Master M's autograph!

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.860
My idol, my hero!

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:31.750
That's why you're excited...

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.150
Come to think of it, this 
time it's a team battle, huh?

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:41.200
At the last tournament, Card Capital's team, 
Q4, made it as far as nationals, right?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.500
As a result, the number of participants 
keeps growing and growing.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.960
I mean, if we didn't have team 
fights, we'd never finish.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.650
You're overexcited...

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.440
Team fight...

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.200
That means...

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:58.200
the formation of Team Ninja-degozaru!

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.440
Oh, he declined.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:08.550
What?!

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.170
"My age has ended-degozaru."

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.850
is what he said.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:17.020
I suppose he didn't have any 
friends to form a team with.

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.500
Say it ain't so...

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:21.040
My idol, my hero...

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.790
Morikawa...

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:25.760
Oh, that's right. I've been 
holding on to something for you.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:29.960
Misaki, give that parcel 
over there to Morikawa.

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:34.960
This?

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.760
Th-That's...

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.540
The shop tournament starts tomorrow...

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:21.150
You can't beat them yet, 
not with your skill...

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.040
Not yet...

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:25.920
Kai!

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:30.500
I'm gonna get stronger! I 
swear I'll get stronger!

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.270
This time I'll win for sure!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.260
For the sake of everyone in Team Q4...

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:42.320
...and to keep the vow that I made to Kai!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.030
Everyone, lend me your support!

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:36.790
What was that just now?

00:04:38.150 --> 00:04:40.300
I thought I heard a voice...

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.350
Jeez! Aichi!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.130
I kept calling you to come down for dinner!

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.140
Sorry about that!

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.120
I was putting together my deck.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.350
Tomorrow's the shop tournament, see?

00:04:57.350 --> 00:04:58.980
The shop tournament?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.420
Emi, do you want to come watch it?

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:04.580
I've got something to do, so 
I don't think I can make it.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.240
Good luck, though, Aichi!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:06.810
Thanks!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:15.620
The Return of the Ninja Master

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:30.400
And now, the Card Capital 
Shop Tournament will begin!

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:34.810
I give you Team Q4, which made it to the 
national competition representing this shop!

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:38.870
The Cardfighters who beat 
them will grab the glory!

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:41.900
It could be you!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.740
Yeah! Bring it on!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.160
I'll take you all on, one 
before the other one!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.800
"One after the other", right?!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.740
OO, yo!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.150
You sabotaged yourself...

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.170
It's split between A and B blocks,

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:02.170
and you'll be fighting at these 
officially-named Standing Fight Tables.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.840
The winning A team and the winning B team 
will fight each other in the final round.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.020
The team that wins that 
round will be the champion!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.570
I guess we're in B block...

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:12.740
Please watch me, Miss Emi!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:15.690
I dedicate all my victories to you!

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:17.290
Emi said she can't make it.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:19.940
Kamui?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.420
This is no good!

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:25.180
The goddess's support is the 
source of Kamui's power!

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:27.750
KP, yo! DS, yo!

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.670
Can't you do something?!

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:32.750
Cut it out.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:34.370
I understand...

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.040
...Miss Emi's heart...

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:39.330
I believe in you!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:45.640
Even without me cheering you on, even without my 
homemade lunch, you're strong enough to win, Kamui!

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.430
She believes in me!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.010
Please leave it to me, Brother!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.220
Victory will definitely be ours!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:54.830
Yeah!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.970
Even so...

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:01.000
Morikawa and the other guys aren't here.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.300
I wonder what happened.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:06.320
We'll begin in just a moment.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.740
Think carefully about the order 
that you're going to fight in.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.290
That's right!

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.830
Please consider the fighting order
 of your team carefully.

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.020
I'm not playing.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:15.720
Kai?!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.710
Just you three do it.

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:22.470
If you can't win a tournament at this level, 
you don't have a chance of winning at nationals.

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.990
Kai...

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.200
I'll watch.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.970
Well, he is right.

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:32.610
Hmph! You don't have to tell me that! Even 
without you, this is gonna be a cinch!

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.150
Right, Brother?!

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.240
Y-Yeah. Let's do our best!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.200
Well, that's all we can do.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:49.990
Sorry, we've got a full house.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.440
How disappointing!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.340
I wanted to play in the tournament...

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:54.580
I apologize to all Vanguard Fighters 
who couldn't participate today!

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.200
Now, let the Card Capital Shop Tournament...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:58.550
Start!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.970
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.410
Stand up, my avatar!

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.770
I ride Blaster Blade!

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.130
So that's Blaster Blade!

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.160
Cool!

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.460
Here I go!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.750
Asura Kaiser attacks!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:28.110
Finishing Hold!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.830
I-I lost...

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.530
All right! Team Q4 has won the first fight!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.280
I add +7000 to the power of CEO Amaterasu!

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:44.670
Amaterasu attacks!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:57.670
I pay the cost to activate its skill!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:08:59.980
I take a Pongal from my deck...

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:01.740
Superior call!

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.060
Mr. Invincible attacks!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:16.510
Victory

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:16.510
Team Q4

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.460
The winner of B Block, Team Q4!

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:17.690
We did it!

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.810
It's too early to celebrate, Brother.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:21.400
There's still one fight left.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.640
Oh, yeah...

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:23.880
One more fight...

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.390
Team Overthrow?

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:26.240
Team Overthrow

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:35.910
It seems your opponents 
have been chosen-degozaru!

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.000
It's him! It's him!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.770
Ninja Master M?!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:51.870
Huh? There's something different about him...

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:53.680
That's very perceptive of you!

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:56.680
I am the second-generation Ninja Master M!

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:59.570
And I've come to visit-degozaru!

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:01.240
I'm his master!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.140
I've been waiting for this!

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.980
Morikawa...? Izaki...?

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.540
Miwa, you too?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.690
So that's what the package was...

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:12.750
Misaki?

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:13.980
Did you know?!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.380
I'm guessing it was Shin's idea.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:21.300
From the Muromachi era to the Period of 
Warring States, strength was justice.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.510
People who had power fought 
to usurp the authority.

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.450
That is Overthrow!

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:29.940
And now, the present day!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:33.590
That fight has come back 
in the world of Vanguard!

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.580
Ultimately, can they defeat 
the previous champions

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.410
and make history?!

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:43.020
Representing A Block: Team Overthrow!

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.500
Why are you in such high spirits?

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.220
Well, it's like a festival...

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:55.030
Team Overthrow
Team Q4

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:55.030
2nd-Generation Ninja Master M
Misaki Tokura

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.830
Lose-umi is up first, huh?

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.510
I've told you, it's <i>Katsumi</i>!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.230
I-I mean, I don't know who that is...

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:06.700
My name is "Second-Generation 
Ninja Master M"-degozaru.

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:08.870
Really, it's obvious...

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.880
RIO, yo...

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:14.770
With this garb, inherited from my 
predecessor, and secret shinobi techniques,

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.140
I'll defeat you-degozaru!

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:23.090
All right, the first match of 
the Shop Tournament finals!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.320
Team Q4's Misaki Tokura versus 
Second-Generation Ninja Master M!

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:30.540
Ninpou! Strongest Shuffle Jutsu!

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.260
All right, please begin!

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.480
Let's imagine! Let's Vanguard!

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.950
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.040
Degozaru!

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:44.370
Stealth Beast, Hagakure!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.400
Godhawk, Ichibyoshi!

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.220
I go first!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.410
The strongest ninpou, Drawing a Card Jutsu!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.410
Yes! I got a grade 3!

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.160
You're not supposed to say...

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:02.130
My bad-degozaru...

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:18.900
It's the age of Overthrow!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:22.760
After beating Team Q4, 
I'll take power-degozaru!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:29.110
What's the matter?! So terrified 
that words fail you-degozaru?!

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:33.600
Unfortunately for you, I'm not going to hold 
back, even for a female opponent-degozaru!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.980
Watch and tremble!

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.690
My deck has sets of the strongest grade 3s!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:44.490
In addition, I've planted sets of assassins, 
units that you've all lost to before,

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.510
in this megastrong deck!

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:51.140
Faced with the great Morikawa's 
ultra-powerful units,

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:54.080
you'll freeze in fear and flee in defeat!

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:01.300
How many times have I told you? 
Only grade 3s will get you nowhere!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:03.640
And it's totally Morikawa talking...

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.560
Get it together, KM...

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.220
Here I go! Ninpou Dodge Jutsu!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:26.500
H-How...?! I can't use the Dodge Jutsu?

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:31.320
How frustrating! My overpowerful 
deck is so frustrating...

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.580
It's my turn.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.970
Stand and draw...

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:46.690
I activate the skill of Goddess 
of the Half Moon, Tsukuyomi.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.090
I get to look at the top 
five cards of my deck,

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:52.260
and if Goddess of the Full Moon, 
Tsukuyomi, is one of them...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.840
I can superior ride.

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:56.570
Y-You have Dodge Jutsu too?!

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:58.380
Are you a kunoichi-degozaru?!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.240
You didn't get it-degozaru! 
You didn't get it-degozaru!

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:10.390
Even though you had five cards! You 
must have terrible luck today-degozaru!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.990
H-Hey, if you go too far, you'll 
get another yellow card-deojaru!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:17.770
I ride...

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.580
Gentle light that illuminates the darkness...

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.120
Your smile will envelop the world...

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:24.900
Goddess of the Full Moon, Tsukuyomi!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:28.700
W-Why, you...! Playing a 
hidden card is cowardly!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.140
I call Red Eye.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.810
With a boost from Gemini,

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:37.610
Tsukuyomi...

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:39.380
Hey, hold it right there!

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.150
Calm down-degozaru!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.010
...attacks!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:50.090
Twin drive, first check.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.190
Second check.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:57.140
Wait!!

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:01.800
Okay! The winner of the first match...

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:04.270
is Misaki Tokura!

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:12.550
The reason I lost is because my flower 
fortune is unlucky today-degozaru!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.150
Good grief. This is the final round?

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:18.410
I'm surprised he lasted this long.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.640
I guess that means they're pretty good...

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.120
What do we do? What do we do?

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.980
This is serious!

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:32.350
All they need is just one more win 
to clinch the championship-degozaru!

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:35.050
Well, that's because you lost...

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:36.620
Ah, whatever...

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:39.800
No need to panic!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:44.850
I thought this might happen, so I 
prepared a secret weapon-deojaru!

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.620
Secret weapon?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.280
All right, let's move on to the second match.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:55.320
From Team Q4, Kamui Katsuragi!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:56.180
Yeah!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.050
Good luck, Kamui!

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:01.760
Sorry, but you won't get a chance 
to play in the finals, Brother.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:06.340
I've got the win all sewn up already, see?

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.110
This'll be a piece of cake 
for you, Kamui the Great!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:09.410
PC, yo!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:15.160
After I win this, I'll step right up 
to my goddess and tell her how I feel!

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:19.130
And from Team Overthrow...

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:25.780
Princess Maiden!

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.400
Emi?!

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.790
I-I'm not Emi!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.770
I am Princess Maiden.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.520
P-Princess?!

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.160
Just go with it!

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:52.040
I wanted to fight, too!

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:55.650
K-Kamui...?

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:59.010
Is this a dream or a hallucination?!

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:02.570
Miss Emi is right in front of me...?!

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.880
It's working! It's working!

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:08.150
Brilliant

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.190
Well played!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.580
You too, Master!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.930
All right, fight!

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:13.060
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:17.610
S-Sand up... Van...hard...

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.630
That's definitely Miss Emi!

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.390
Uh-oh! Kamui the Great 
is at the breaking point!

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:34.890
TBP, yo!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:36.770
Kamui?

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:41.790
Attack!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.100
There you go, Emi!

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:52.160
I've always dreamed about having 
a Cardfight with my goddess...

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.020
N-Now that dream's come true!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:17:59.540
Um...

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:00.290
Yes?!

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.650
It's your turn, Kamui!

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:05.100
R-Right! My pleasure!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.300
Kamui the Great, please 
get a hold of yourself!

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:09.730
If you don't strut your stuff, you'll LF, yo!

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:14.220
Th-That's right! Calm down, Kamui Katsuragi!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.750
This is important, the final round!

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:21.160
My turn!

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.540
I ride Asura Kaiser!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:28.240
And then I call Death Army Guy!

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:34.900
Here I go!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.000
Jack's Counterblast!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.550
I release Jack!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.900
Death Army Guy boosts!

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:47.140
Jack attacks Top Idol Flores!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:55.440
I guard with Lozenge Magus!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.360
With a boost from Shining Lady,

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:07.050
Death Army Lady attacks!

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.950
I can't guard!

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:18.280
He attacked!

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.610
I didn't think he would attack her...

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.990
I'm sorry, Miss Emi.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:28.740
Even if you're the opponent that I have to 
beat, Miss Emi, I just can't ease up on you!

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.810
I'm sorry, Miss Emi!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.440
Kamui the Great is so admirable!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.630
AK, yo!

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.630
Damage trigger check!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.600
I got it! Heal trigger!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:43.910
I heal damage!

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:48.640
I'm so happy for you!

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:50.720
Say what?!

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:54.760
I stand and draw!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.910
I call Sakuya!

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.570
Caravel exits the field!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.750
With a boost from Gemini,

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.410
Flores attacks!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.570
No guard!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.550
Twin drive!

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.080
First check!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.140
I got it! What good luck!

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:27.140
Bravo! Go ahead, draw once more!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:28.700
Second check!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.930
Look! Two stars!

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.700
C-Congrat...

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.670
...ulations!

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:52.020
That was fun, Kamui!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:56.560
For me too, Miss... Emi...

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:03.610
The winner of the second 
match, Princess Maiden!

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:08.050
Yay!!

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:11.950
K-Kamui the Great?!

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:18.200
My goddess in her bathing suit 
waved to me from the pool...

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:20.510
Please come back to us, Kamui the Great!

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:22.080
CB, yo!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:25.070
This makes it 1-1.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:27.320
The next match will decide the winner.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:29.800
You did it! But I wouldn't 
expect any less from my pupil!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.270
True that!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.560
I'm going to fight you, Miwa?

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:43.100
Um...

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:46.580
This will be my first time 
fighting with you, right-deojaru?

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:50.170
Now that you mention it, I've 
never even seen you fight, Miwa.

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.530
He who knows most speaks 
least or whatever-deojaru.

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:58.190
Who do you think used to be

00:21:58.600 --> 00:21:59.990
Kai's practice partner?

00:22:02.260 --> 00:22:04.090
Are you ready?

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:53.400
Kamui lost to Emi.

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:56.040
I'm not Emi, I'm Princess Maiden!

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:58.290
Oh, that's right. You were a shrine maiden.

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:00.050
And my opponent is going to be...

00:24:00.390 --> 00:24:01.860
Maro-deojaru.

00:24:01.860 --> 00:24:04.420
Prepare yourself, Aichi Sendou-deojaru.

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:05.000
Right?

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:07.400
Right! Prepare! Prepare!

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:10.260
Next time: Miwa's Ability

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:11.160
Miwa...

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:14.530
I mean Miwa Chief Councilor of State Crown 
Prince, I picture you as being really strong...

00:24:14.530 --> 00:24:16.240
Maro <i>is</i> strong-deojaru.

00:24:16.240 --> 00:24:17.440
No exaggeration!
